{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2021-12-16 11:28:00', 'title': 'HSBC AND IBM SUCCESSFULLY DESIGN AND TEST INTEROPERABLE MULTI-LEDGER CENTRAL BANK DIGITAL CURRENCY, SECURITIES AND FOREIGN EXCHANGE SETTLEMENT CAPABILITY', 'text': 'LONDON AND NEW YORK, DEC. 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0HSBC AND IBM (NYSE: IBM) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE SUCCESSFUL TEST OF AN ADVANCED TOKEN AND DIGITAL WALLET SETTLEMENT CAPABILITY ENCOMPASSING DIRECT TRANSACTIONS BETWEEN TWO CENTRAL BANK DIGITAL CURRENCIES (CBDC) IN A HYBRID CLOUD ENVIRONMENT. SEVERAL PREVIOUS INITIATIVES HAVE INDIVIDUALLY DEMONSTRATED SUPPORT FOR CDBCS, SECURITIES AND/OR FOREIGN EXCHANGE.'}